{"id":"en_love-misplaced-hearts-reunited","title":"Love Misplaced, Hearts Reunited","titleEn":"Love Misplaced, Hearts Reunited","description":"Five years after a car accident that badly injured Ralf and caused Jenna to disappear, the two former lovers remain separated by more than distance. Ralf had been led to believe that Jenna was the spy responsible for sabotaging his family’s business. Now Jenna comes back to his city, and she does not return alone: she brings the son she and Ralf share. Her reappearance forces the old accusations and the truth about the past back into the open.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-misplaced-hearts-reunited/id_ID/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-misplaced-hearts-reunited/id_ID/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Sweet Romance","Secret","Secret Child","Suspenseful","Secret"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cda0i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_love-misplaced-hearts-reunited_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cda0i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-misplaced-hearts-reunited_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cda0i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-misplaced-hearts-reunited_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cda0i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-misplaced-hearts-reunited_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cda0i/?pub=4occak","